  "question": {
    "text": "Two small spheres each of mass <math><mi>m</mi></math> and charge <math><mi>q</mi></math> are tied from the same rigid support with the help of silk threads of length <math><mi>L</mi></math>. They make angle <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></math> with the vertical as shown in the figure. If length <math><mi>L</mi></math> is decreased, then angle <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></math> with the vertical&nbsp;<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/66534.PNG\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 191px;\" />",
